From d00ecda181d1b2b320c7423087d07dcdb42cd0d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:26:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD resolved-review feature completion prompts with
 robust review markers

Resolved reviews move the patch-agent chat into a yes/no completion checkpoint so users can close reviewed work without resuming the agent, while later chat input reopens the feature. Review marker parsing uses standalone FINDINGS and NO_FINDINGS lines so streamed prose does not accidentally resolve or hide findings.
